	"data": "Osaka University — IST (Information Science and Technology)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research. See also [[projects/mext-scholarship-2029|Mext Scholarship 2029]] for funding details.\n\nOverview\n\nOsaka University (officially \"The University of Osaka\" in English as of 2024) has a strong XR tradition — Prof. Kiyokawa (now NAIST) was at the Cybermedia Center 2002-2017. The Graduate School of Information Science and Technology offers an ITSCE English track, and…",
